# Optional proxy for the crawler. Copy to .env and fill in; .env is gitignored.
#
# DataImpulse parameters go in the *login*, not the host, and the value must be quoted
# because the ASN parameter is separated by ';':
#
#   __cr.de           country targeting. Worth more than extra threads:
#                     541 ads/min without it against 823 with it, same concurrency.
#   ;asn.3320         a single ISP. The default pool mixes real homes with hosting
#                     providers (Limestone, Datacamp, ALEXHOST...), and Cloudflare
#                     refuses the hosting ones — 3 of 20 requests locally, and every
#                     request from a GitHub runner. AS3320 is Deutsche Telekom:
#                     20 of 20 succeeded, and the crawl ran faster for it.
#
# BAZARAKI_PROXY="http://USER__cr.de;asn.3320:PASSWORD@gw.dataimpulse.com:823"
